# Exception: an accumulating, tracked benchmark log (PLAN.md §27d task S1.1) --
# scripts/benchmark_pipeline.py appends to this on purpose so throughput is
# visible over time in git history, unlike the *.csv rule above's per-run
# scratch output.
!docs/benchmark_history.csv

# Exception: the committed demo slice (PLAN.md §27d W1.1) -- a real, few-hundred-row
# sample of cache/protein_selector.db plus the report it produces, so a fresh clone has
# something real to look at (`make demo`) without running the real pipeline first.
# Rebuilt via `scripts/build_demo_slice.py`, not hand-edited; re-run and re-commit it
# deliberately, don't add a second exception pattern here for future demo artifacts.
!demo/protein_selector_demo.db
!demo/report_demo.csv
slurm/logs/
